  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Cook penne in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 10 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63114444f1fc3d677c047c75/step-69bcf96e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice zucchini into thin half-moons.\n• Roughly chop capsicum.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63114444f1fc3d677c047c75/step-5898bca5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook zucchini and capsicum until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Reduce heat to low and add the brown sugar, all-purpose seasoning, garlic seasoning and passata. Simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63114444f1fc3d677c047c75/step-0bc4ed97.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium. Add cooked pasta, baby spinach leaves, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using), the pasta water and the butter to the sauce. Stir to combine. Season with pepper.\n• Divide pasta between bowls. Top with crumbled fetta to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63114444f1fc3d677c047c75/step-0aadd967.jpg"
    }
  ]
